      "id": "cnt-002",
      "title": "5 Easy Tips to Help Your Child Master Multiplication Without Rote Memorization",
      "message": "Many parents struggle when it comes to helping children memorize multiplication tables. Try our proven visual math technique that boosts comprehension by 80% within two weeks! 💡\n\n1. Start with multiples of 2, 5, and 10\n2. Use LEGO blocks or tangible physical objects\n3. Practice rhythmic chant patterns\n4. Conduct 5-minute visual flashcard sessions\n5. Offer consistent encouragement for small milestones",
      "cta_text": "Download Free Math E-Book",
      "cta_url": "https://alaminedu.com.my/ebook-multiplication",
      "format": "carousel",
      "status": "published",
      "category_id": "cat-002",
      "tags": [
        "ParentingTips",
        "EasyMath",
        "KidsEducation"
      ],
